---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Legal notice"
  description="Legal notice of the personal site of Bastien Tanésie."
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Legal notice</h1>
  <section class="mt-8" aria-labelledby="legal-publisher">
    <h2 id="legal-publisher" class="text-xl font-semibold">
      Publisher
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      This site is published by Bastien Tanésie, acting as a private individual.
      It can be reached through the profiles listed in the footer.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="mt-8" aria-labelledby="legal-host">
    <h2 id="legal-host" class="text-xl font-semibold">
      Hosting
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      This site is hosted by GitHub, Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. Street, San
      Francisco, CA 94107, United States, through GitHub Pages.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="mt-8" aria-labelledby="legal-tracking">
    <h2 id="legal-tracking" class="text-xl font-semibold">
      Tracking
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      This site does not use cookies, analytics or any third-party tracking. No
      personal data is collected by the publisher.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="mt-8" aria-labelledby="legal-logs">
    <h2 id="legal-logs" class="text-xl font-semibold">
      Server logs
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      As the host, GitHub may collect technical logs such as IP addresses when
      pages are served. The publisher has no control over these logs; see
      <a
        href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement"
        rel="noopener"
        class="underline underline-offset-4"
      >
        GitHub's privacy statement
      </a>
      .
    </p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
